<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman raises St. Paul.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman raises St. Paul.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Bruce Harting upgraded St. Paul Bancorp Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Among points cited in a summary report, the analyst said management recently stepped up its first share repurchase. &quot;Management acknowledges that St. Paul is overcapitalized, which hints at further repurchases,&quot; the report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-3/16 to 27-3/8.</p>
</text>
